sequenceDiagram
  participant Dr as Dr. Example One
  participant Lab as Example Dental Lab
  participant FD as Receptionist R1
  participant Acc as Accountant
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  Dr->>Web: New lab order, Submit to lab
  Web->>API: POST /lab-orders, then POST /lab-orders/:id/submit
  API->>PG: prices frozen, LAB number, revision 1, magic link row
  Dr->>Lab: Copy link and paste it into a chat
  Lab->>API: POST /lab-link/:token/accept, or POST /lab-portal/orders/:id/accept
  API->>PG: items accepted, stages created, vendor bill draft VB
  Lab->>API: POST /lab-portal/production/items/:itemId/start, finish, qc - portal login needed
  Lab->>API: POST /lab-portal/production/shipments
  API->>PG: shipment SHP, stage sent_to_clinic
  FD->>Web: Receive shipment, scan QR
  Web->>API: POST /lab-shipments/:id/receive
  Dr->>Web: Record try-in, then Approve or Needs correction
  Web->>API: POST /lab-orders/:id/stages/:stageId/tryin and /decision
  Lab->>API: final shipment, received by the front desk the same way
  Dr->>Web: Approve work, then Fitted mark delivered
  Web->>API: POST /lab-orders/:id/items/:itemId/approve and /deliver
  API->>PG: item delivered, 12-month warranty, order completed
  Acc->>Web: Bill lab work to the patient
  Web->>API: POST /lab-billing/invoices, POST /lab-billing/invoices/:id/issue
  API->>PG: invoice LINV, commission snapshot
  Acc->>Web: Approve vendor bill, Pay lab
  Web->>API: POST /lab-payables/bills/:id/approve, POST /lab-payables/payments
  API->>PG: journals, payable settled
